{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d4d6f000d05e78aadcfc379780a4bdc94a2061b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 是面向 DSH Web 侧栏的会话管理插件：在会话菜单和悬停行按钮中加入删除入口，并通过确认弹窗提交操作。Host 端先归档会话，再删除持久化日志目录、解除工作区关联并通知客户端刷新。它会拒绝正在打开或运行中的会话，并在成功后显示提示。适合希望清理 DSH 会话记录的桌面用户；需要 DSH 桌面版，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:229-257","host.js:97-169"]}
{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d4d6f000d05e78aadcfc379780a4bdc94a2061b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-delete adds session removal to the DSH sidebar. A menu item and hover button open a confirmation dialog. The host archives the session, deletes its stored log, and refreshes the client list. Active sessions are refused. No extra key or service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:229-257","host.js:97-169"]}
